"""Hermetic Git integration and generated byte/filename coverage for the guard.

Fixture commits use commit-tree; hook tests use ordinary git commit with the
production pre-commit hook, ratchet and project configuration. A tiny suite
wrapper records whether the count check runs after the hygiene check.
No production hook is disabled, and no test touches a user's repository state.
"""
